1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,580
M: Have you gotten used to the new software John installed on your computer yet?

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:08,000
It's supposed to be faster and easier to use than the program that was originally there.

3
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:11,480
W: I don't know because I haven't had the time to use it yet.

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,920
I've been away on a business trip and just got back this morning.

5
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:19,560
Tell you what, I will try it out this morning and let you know how it is at lunch.

6
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:23,780
I just hope it won't take long for me to learn how to use the program.

7
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,780
M: You shouldn't have any problems with it.

8
00:00:26,245 --> 00:00:28,840
The command keys are exactly the same as the old program.

9
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:29,880
W: Is that right?

10
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,785
I guess I won't have any problems using it then.
